  unitName: Fractured Mind Ydra
  unitId: 840968
  unitNumber: 8644
  description: "Inmate ID: XX-13-0Charges: -Cell: Solitary ConfinementNotes: Supervise
    at ALL TIMES.The 13th Correctional Facility (known as \"the Madhouse\" to those
    in the field) carries the notorious reputation of housing the most violent and
    unrepentant criminals, along with those who aren't \"all there\" in the head.
    The last category, of course, is always omitted from official records; no one
    needs to know about those Especially about one particular prisoner being caged
    in the bowels of the facility.Apart from her name, little else is known about
    Ydra, including why she was brought to the facility in the first place. The young
    woman is surprisingly lucid and well-read for someone permanently strapped into
    a straitjacket, and her wide eyes either stare off into space or track her keepers
    across the room. The supervisor's notes only indicate the time and duration of
    each session with the facility's therapist, ending abruptly with a redacted entry
    and no further visitations. Wardens whisper, of course, and talk of devilish
    giggles and mercurial moods painted Ydra in an unsettling, almost demonically
    possessed, light.During the Survivor Games, Ydra had the good fortune (or perhaps
    Saya had the misfortune) to find an ally of convenience in the chainsaw-wielding
    felon. Her mind a delicate maze of madness, one can only imagine whether Ydra
    sees leaving her cage as freedom enough\u2014even if it was still within the
    locked-down facility. And if the laser-blades strapped to her ankles are any
    indication, this may have been a greater experiment altogether..."
  summonDesc: Oh, I know.<br>I wouldn't trust me, either.<br>But we don't have a
    choice now, do we...?
  fusionDesc: Should I reciprocate?<br>...Hehe.
  evoDesc: Hehehe...<br>Ahahahahaha!
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
